    "type": "game",
    "name": "Assassins Arena",
    "steam_appid": 3652570,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Assassins Arena \u2013 Hide in Plain Sight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Assassins Arena</i> is a competitive online stealth game for 2\u20138 players where everyone looks like an NPC\u2014but only some of them are real. Your goal? Blend into the crowd, outsmart your opponents, and strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not faster or stronger, you\u2019re just smarter. Every action matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look Like an NPC</strong><br>Your character behaves exactly like AI civilians\u2014walking, stopping, doing tasks. You must mimic this behavior to avoid suspicion from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt &amp; Assassinate</strong><br>Depending on the mode, you must eliminate other players while staying hidden. Press one button to assassinate\u2014but if you get it wrong, your position is revealed for seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid Mistakes</strong><br>Kill the wrong NPC, and everyone will see who you really are. You only get one chance to stay invisible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective System</strong><br>Certain locations on the map allow you to interact for clues. But standing still makes you vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Mode</strong> \u2013 All players chase the same NPC. First to strike wins\u2014or dies trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elimination Mode</strong> \u2013 No one has a specific target. Kill other players while avoiding detection. The last player standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Mode</strong> \u2013 Two teams: one protects a disguised NPC, the other must find and assassinate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player</strong> \u2013 Play against AI targets. One wrong kill ends the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Maps &amp; Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match takes place in a stylized map packed with animated NPCs. Maps range from city streets and pirate docks to western towns. NPCs follow randomized behaviors, so blending in requires timing, movement, and acting skills.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Assassins Arena \u2013 Hide in Plain Sight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Assassins Arena</i> is a competitive online stealth game for 2\u20138 players where everyone looks like an NPC\u2014but only some of them are real. Your goal? Blend into the crowd, outsmart your opponents, and strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not faster or stronger, you\u2019re just smarter. Every action matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look Like an NPC</strong><br>Your character behaves exactly like AI civilians\u2014walking, stopping, doing tasks. You must mimic this behavior to avoid suspicion from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt &amp; Assassinate</strong><br>Depending on the mode, you must eliminate other players while staying hidden. Press one button to assassinate\u2014but if you get it wrong, your position is revealed for seconds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid Mistakes</strong><br>Kill the wrong NPC, and everyone will see who you really are. You only get one chance to stay invisible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective System</strong><br>Certain locations on the map allow you to interact for clues. But standing still makes you vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Mode</strong> \u2013 All players chase the same NPC. First to strike wins\u2014or dies trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elimination Mode</strong> \u2013 No one has a specific target. Kill other players while avoiding detection. The last player standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Mode</strong> \u2013 Two teams: one protects a disguised NPC, the other must find and assassinate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player</strong> \u2013 Play against AI targets. One wrong kill ends the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Maps &amp; Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match takes place in a stylized map packed with animated NPCs. Maps range from city streets and pirate docks to western towns. NPCs follow randomized behaviors, so blending in requires timing, movement, and acting skills.</p>",
    "short_description": "Assassins Arena is a stealth-based multiplayer party game where you blend in with NPCs, subdue your targets, and deceive your opponents! Outsmart others in fast-paced, action-packed matches, either single player or online with 2-8 players.",
